---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
---
<BlockLayout title="Agreement Room · PointCast Mist V2" description="A local, fictional example of making something together.">
  <main class="room">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/chain/">PointCast chain</a> <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span> Agreement Room</nav>
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">POINTCAST MIST V2 · WORKING NAME</p><h1>Let’s make<br/><em>something</em> together.</h1><p class="intro">A friendly room for making plans, changing your mind and keeping a record of what everyone agreed to.</p><p class="notice"><strong>A pretend room.</strong> Ari, Bo and the studio bot are fictional. Your choices stay in this browser tab until you download or reset them. Nothing is signed, sent, published or written to a blockchain.</p></div>
      <div class="illustration" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sun">✳</div><div class="record"><span>♪</span><i></i></div><div class="paper">FRIDAY<br/>LISTENING<br/>ROOM <small>VOL. 01 ✦</small></div><div class="spark">✺</div></div>
    </header>
    <section class="layout" aria-label="Example agreement">
      <article class="sheet"><p class="eyebrow">THE ARRANGEMENT · EXAMPLE ONLY</p><h2>Friday’s listening room</h2><p>Ari and Bo are imagining a little card with a rhythm and an image. Both must approve the same version before it can be marked complete in this example.</p>
        <div class="terms"><div class="terms-title"><span>THE CURRENT PLAN</span><span id="revision">VERSION 1</span></div><p id="terms">A short rhythm and an image for Friday’s listening room.</p><p class="terms-foot">The studio bot may suggest. It cannot approve, publish or act for a person.</p></div>
        <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Room</dt><dd id="status">Draft</dd></div><div><dt>Ari’s approval</dt><dd id="ari-approval">Not yet</dd></div><div><dt>Bo’s approval</dt><dd id="bo-approval">Not yet</dd></div></dl>
        <p id="change" class="change" hidden>Change requested. Update the plan before approving it.</p>
        <p id="review" class="change" hidden>The review desk suggests trying a different image. This is advice, not a decision or an approval.</p>
        <p id="suggestion" class="change" hidden>The studio bot suggested a quieter arrangement. This suggestion has no authority.</p>
        <div class="controls"><h3>Try the room</h3><p>Choose a fictional role and an action. You can play all sides of this demonstration.</p>
          <label for="actor">Example role</label><select id="actor"><option>Ari</option><option>Bo</option><option>Studio bot</option><option>Review desk</option></select>
          <div class="buttons"><button type="button" data-action="invite">Open invitation</button><button type="button" data-action="accept_invitation">Accept invitation</button><button type="button" data-action="suggest">Bot suggests</button><button type="button" data-action="request_change">Request a change</button><button type="button" data-action="request_review">Request a review</button><button type="button" data-action="review_suggest">Review desk suggests</button><button type="button" data-action="amend">Update the plan</button><button type="button" data-action="approve">Approve this version</button><button type="button" data-action="complete">Mark example complete</button><button type="button" data-action="cancel" class="quiet">Cancel example</button></div>
          <p id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">Start as Ari and open the invitation.</p><button id="reset" type="button" class="link-button">Start over</button>
        </div>
      </article>
      <aside class="side"><div class="note"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL PROMISE</p><h2>Clarity before clicks.</h2><p>An invitation is not an approval. A change creates a new version and clears earlier approvals. Either example collaborator can cancel before completion.</p><p>Completing this example does not publish anything or create an agreement between real people.</p></div><div class="note yellow"><p class="eyebrow">KEEP A COPY</p><h2>A record, your way.</h2><p>The public example excludes the private feedback and history. The private example includes both. Downloads are created on your device; review before sharing.</p><button id="public-export" type="button">Download public example</button><button id="private-export" type="button" class="secondary">Download private example</button><p class="fine">No wallet, account or blockchain required. Reloading the page resets this demonstration.</p></div><div class="note plain"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT COMES NEXT</p><p>PointCast Mist V2 is a working product name, separate from the existing read-only Mist explorer and the current devnet. This is a product experiment, not a contract service. Real participants, signing, shared storage, review authority and network enforcement need separate design and verification.</p><a href="/chain/mist/">Explore PointCast Mist →</a></div></aside>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/chain/agreement/ui.js"></script>
</BlockLayout>
<style>
  .room{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:30px 24px 90px;color:#262a26;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif} nav{font-size:.8rem;color:#526154} a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:3px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:62px 0}.eyebrow{font:700 .7rem/1.3 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#69796a}.hero h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7vw,6.5rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:20px 0}.hero h1 em{color:#e06441;font-weight:400}.intro{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.55;max-width:31rem}.notice{background:#eff4ea;border-left:4px solid #708e6c;padding:16px 18px;line-height:1.55;max-width:38rem}.illustration{height:360px;background:#dfeada;border-radius:48% 48% 6px 6px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.sun{position:absolute;top:12%;right:12%;font-size:4rem;color:#edbd56}.record{position:absolute;width:210px;height:210px;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-radial-gradient(circle,#2a3b34 0 2px,#34493e 3px 6px);left:13%;top:31%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#f5da96;font-size:3rem}.record i{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#f8eed7}.record span{transform:translateY(-39px)}.paper{position:absolute;right:9%;bottom:10%;background:#faf1dd;box-shadow:2px 8px 18px #31523b36;transform:rotate(8deg);padding:30px 25px;font:700 1.3rem/1.05 Georgia,serif}.paper small{display:block;margin-top:24px;font:700 .65rem monospace}.spark{position:absolute;left:17%;top:14%;font-size:3rem;color:#e06441}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.65fr) minmax(250px,.85fr);gap:24px;align-items:start}.sheet,.note{border:1px solid #cbd5c8;border-radius:4px;padding:30px;background:#fff}.sheet h2,.note h2{font:400 2rem/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.sheet p,.note p{line-height:1.6}.terms{background:#f5f5ed;padding:20px;margin:24px 0}.terms-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font:700 .7rem monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.terms>p:not(.terms-foot){font:1.25rem/1.4 Georgia,serif}.terms-foot,.fine{font-size:.8rem;color:#59675b}.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.facts dt{font-size:.75rem;color:#627063}.facts dd{margin:5px 0;font-weight:650}.change{padding:12px;background:#fff0d2}.controls{border-top:1px solid #dce3d9;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px}.controls h3{font:1.5rem Georgia,serif}.controls label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin:15px 0 6px}select{font:inherit;padding:10px;border:1px solid #a6b4a5;border-radius:3px;background:white}.buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:18px 0}button{font:600 .85rem/1.25 system-ui,sans-serif;border:1px solid #344c3a;border-radius:3px;padding:11px 14px;background:#344c3a;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#526c53}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #df804d;outline-offset:3px}.quiet,.secondary{background:white;color:#344c3a}.link-button{border:0;color:#344c3a;background:transparent;padding:4px 0;text-decoration:underline}.side{display:grid;gap:16px}.note{background:#edf3ea}.note.yellow{background:#fff2cf}.note.plain{background:#fff}.note button{width:100%;margin:4px 0}.fine{margin-top:18px}#feedback{min-height:2em;color:#38573c;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:720px){.room{padding:22px 18px 60px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:35px 0;gap:20px}.illustration{height:250px;max-width:390px;width:100%}.record{width:145px;height:145px}.record span{transform:translateY(-25px)}.paper{padding:19px}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sheet,.note{padding:22px}.facts{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.buttons button{flex:1 1 145px}}
</style>
